<!--
  Android TV launcher banner.

  Mandatory for a leanback app: without one the launcher shows a blank tile. The
  required aspect is 320x180, and the artwork must carry the app name because TV
  launchers draw no label beneath the tile - which is why this is the one asset
  that keeps the wordmark. Both the kanji pair and the Latin name appear here, and
  the pair's 2.015:1 ratio is why this landscape canvas is the only place the full
  Signature lockup fits.

  Generated from watchbox-tv-banner.svg (640x360, twice the shipped size) by baking
  its nested transforms into absolute coordinates and halving to 320x180.

  The O of WATCHBOX is an <ellipse> in the source, which has no vector-drawable
  equivalent, so it is emitted as two half arcs. A first pass that collected only
  d= attributes silently dropped it and shipped "WATCHB X"; the pixel diff against
  the source is what caught it.

  A vector rather than a PNG so it stays sharp on 4K panels and costs nothing in
  APK size. The wordmark is outlined geometry, so it needs no font on the device.
-->
